{"4978660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Medieval Doctor", "steam_appid": 4978660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own medieval hospital and become the kingdom's most renowned physician. Examine patients, diagnose diseases, craft herbal remedies, and save lives through the treatments you provide. Start with a small clinic and expand it into a respected center of healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/bb51807e6dd37265f5b1258c6ef0f5aa.poster.avif?t=1785357640\" aria-label=\"⭐ Explore the Map: Venture through forests, rivers, mountains, and villages in a handcrafted medieval kingdom. Search for rare medicinal herbs, discover hidden locations, and travel wherever your patients need you most.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/bb51807e6dd37265f5b1258c6ef0f5aa.webm?t=1785357640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/bb51807e6dd37265f5b1258c6ef0f5aa.mp4?t=1785357640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Map:⭐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through forests, rivers, mountains, and villages in a handcrafted medieval kingdom. Search for rare medicinal herbs, discover hidden locations, and travel wherever your patients need you most...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/39fe59af52cad3be4f6f310fb8ad4087.poster.avif?t=1785357640\" aria-label=\"⭐ Town: Explore a lively medieval town filled with villagers, merchants, and patients seeking your help. Walk through its streets, discover new opportunities, and become the trusted physician of the community.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/39fe59af52cad3be4f6f310fb8ad4087.webm?t=1785357640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/39fe59af52cad3be4f6f310fb8ad4087.mp4?t=1785357640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town:⭐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a lively medieval town filled with villagers, merchants, and patients seeking your help. Walk through its streets, discover new opportunities, and become the trusted physician of the community...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/967bce89d7de5101cc59f93c066b79f8.poster.avif?t=1785357640\" aria-label=\"⭐ Craft Herbal Medicines: Carefully grind medicinal herbs into fine powder before brewing remedies. Precision and the right ingredients are the foundation of every successful treatment.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/967bce89d7de5101cc59f93c066b79f8.webm?t=1785357640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978660/extras/967bce89d7de5101cc59f93c066b79f8.mp4?t=1785357640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Herbal Medicines:⭐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully grind medicinal herbs into fine powder before brewing remedies. Precision and the right ingredients are the foundation of every successful treatment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co